        <mxCell id="vuJTIm96bQAWBJX1B6yz-106" parent="vuJTIm96bQAWBJX1B6yz-107" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Role:&lt;/b&gt; A list of explicit file paths or glob patterns identifying the files the user currently has open or that the task touches (e.g., &lt;code&gt;[&quot;src/auth/jwt.py&quot;, &quot;src/auth/routes.py&quot;]&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Function:&lt;/b&gt; Acts as a &lt;b&gt;hard boundary filter&lt;/b&gt; for repository rules and directory-level configurations (&lt;code&gt;.cursorrules&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AGENTS.md&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CLAUDE.md&lt;/code&gt;). It prevents irrelevant rules (such as frontend UI conventions or database migration rules) from polluting the context when working strictly in backend auth files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="263.19" width="255.06364285714284" y="37.75999999999999" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
