        <mxCell id="vuJTIm96bQAWBJX1B6yz-545" parent="vuJTIm96bQAWBJX1B6yz-548" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Line from AI Coding Agent ---&amp;gt; Write-Back Gateway (Candidate Memory):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Google Sans Text, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;When the agent finishes editing code, it drafts a candidate reflection or memory chunk (e.g., &lt;i style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&quot;To fix token expiry, I bypassed Redis and used in-memory dictionaries&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;). At this stage, this memory is unverified and potentially toxic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Line from Code Execution &amp;amp; Test Suite &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;---&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; Write-Back Gateway (Ground-Truth Telemetry):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Google Sans Text, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The sandbox/CI runner executes the unit tests, linters, and integration checks on the agent&#39;s edits. It sends the objective outcome (e.g., &lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;tests_passed: true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;security_scan: passed&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;) directly to the gateway.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Line from Write-Back Gateway &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;---&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; Episodic Vector Storage (Sanitized Persistence):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Google Sans Text, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The gateway correlates the agent&#39;s candidate memory with the test outcome. If tests failed or the solution violated a Tier 1 security constraint, the memory is discarded. If tests passed and the memory is clean, it is tagged with metadata and persisted to vector storage.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="470" width="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vuJTIm96bQAWBJX1B6yz-547" parent="vuJTIm96bQAWBJX1B6yz-548" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Write-back Gateway Definition&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="320" x="95" y="10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
